  m2b-2 keeps only part (a); the markup crossed out its part (b), which
  parametrized the trace in the plane y = sqrt(6).

  The five quadric-surface problems that this assignment was built from
  (exercise-quadric-graph-match, rf-5, rw23-7, rw21-10 and m2b-2) were moved
