  instructor's request, in this student-facing skeletal book only.  The file
  keeps its old name.

  The five lines-and-planes problems at the start (rf-4, rw21-5, rs19-5,
  pp-17 and m2b-5) were moved here from the end of
  assignment-5-cross-product-lines-planes.ptx at the instructor's request,
